    "short_description": "Forbes is a leading international media company with a rich history of 93 years, known for its authoritative business journalism. Operating as Forbes Global Media Holdings, Inc., it showcases influential figures and provides comprehensive content solutions across print, digital, social, and video formats.\n\nThe company focuses on delivering high-quality journalism characterized by a clear voice and strict editorial standards. Its platforms cater to business leaders, influencers, and the general public, offering insightful news and analysis that drives transformation in the business world. Forbes also collaborates with media partners and brands, providing content solutions that enhance marketing and content distribution efforts.",
